	<!-- PAGE CONTENT -->
<div class="o-block">
	<div class="o-block__inner">
		        <p>&nbsp;</p>
		<h1 class="u-page-title">Public Data</h1>
				
		
<!-- general:4518 -->

<!-- BLOCK: General -->
<div class="c-general">
		<p>HCAD's data files are available to users for import into other applications. Some of the ASCII tab-delimited text files are complex and most of the files are very large. Download times can be excessive and should not be attempted with a slower internet connection. A file compression utility (<a href="http://www.winzip.com/" title="http://www.winzip.com/" target="_blank">WinZip</a>) is needed to extract the files.</p>
</div>



<!-- columns:4519 -->

<!-- BLOCK: Columns -->
<div class="c-general">
		<div class="c-2cols">
				<div class="c-2cols__col">
			<h2>Public Data Timeline</h2>
<ul><li><strong>January</strong>: All Values Pending - Real and Personal
</li><li><strong>April</strong>: Preliminary Values - Real
</li><li><strong>May (Tentatively)</strong>: Preliminary Values - ARB Hearings
</li><li><strong>June(Tentatively)</strong>: Preliminary Values - Personal
</li><li><strong>May thru August</strong>: Preliminary Values are updated Weekly
</li><li><strong>Mid August</strong>: Certified Values
</li></ul>
		</div>
						<div class="c-2cols__col">
			<h2><a href="http://hcad.org/pdata/pdata-property-downloads.html" target="_blank">Download Property Data</a></h2>
<p>Consists of certified/preliminary values from the HCAD Real and Personal property databases.
</p>
<h2><a href="http://hcad.org/pdata/pdata-gis-downloads.html" target="_blank">Download GIS Data</a> </h2>
<p>Please reference the GIS Help document <a href="https://hcad.org/assets/uploads/pdf/resources/2026/GIS-ReadMeV2-2.pdf">here</a> for a full list of fields being provided and system generated fields being dropped.</p>
<p>Consists of current year GIS format files including the prior year shapefiles.
</p>
<h2><a href="/hcad-online-services/pdata/pdata-help" target="_blank">Need Help?</a></h2>
<p>Data import instructions, Data definitions, Codebook and GIS help.
</p>
<hr>
<p> 
</p>
<h4><strong><em>HCAD does not provide technical support for the usage of this data.</em></strong></h4>
		</div>
					</div>
</div>






		
		<p>&nbsp;</p>
	</div>
</div>




